summary:
VANCOUVER, British Columbia, Aug. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Madison Pacific Properties Inc. (the Company) (TSX: MPC and MPC.C), a Vancouver-based real estate company announces the results of operations for the six months ended June 30, 2026.

The results reported are pursuant to International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS) for public companies.

For the six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company is reporting a net income of $16.0 million (six months ended June 30, 2025: $22.4 million);
